ture":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"RED characterization found a production defect: because Mode inherits str, functools.total_ordering preserves inherited str.__gt__, so bootstrap-throttle > reconcile-check is evaluated lexically and returns false. Created child bug 3c6a-4999-7466-46b1; the parent hierarchy records provenance because an explicit discovered_from link would be redundant. The test-only parent remains unchanged in scope; the child owns the production repair before these compatibility tests land.","timestamp":1786150554128037001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Compatibility characterization is GREEN after child 3c6a repairs the discovered rank-order defect. tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/orchestrate/test_mode.py pins the exact five-entry MODE_CAPS mapping. tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/state/test_advisory_lock.py writes and reads reconcile-check through the real ref backend, proves bootstrap-throttle is blocked, and proves equal reconcile-check remains allowed. Combined focused suites pass 14/14; no production file is part of this ticket's commit.","timestamp":1786151386480795001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"[operator-attested] Gerrit 1531 merged with LLM-Review +1, Verified +1, and zero unresolved comments. CI https://github.com/navapbc/rebar/actions/runs/31233237684 passed all OS/Python matrices. Commit 43448cd486 is test-only for this ticket: it pins the complete five-mode MODE_CAPS mapping and exercises the real ref-backed gated_mode reconcile-check round trip, blocking bootstrap-throttle while allowing the equal target. Focused suites, make lint, and make typecheck passed; existing vocabulary and runtime behavior remain unchanged.","timestamp":1786155669207721001}],"created_at":1786149627404913001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"4fe1f14c-c991-42db-ae89-fd7d004dff30","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"64df-ec15-b6a2-4198"},{"link_uuid":"8db08105-08ae-49f9-a299-04caf1560125","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"6b6a-50ea-a031-4752"}],"description":"## Context\n\nThis parent ticket pins the legacy reconciler mode-cap and phase-gate contract. Its own landed change adds direct characterization coverage for the complete five-mode MODE_CAPS table and the real ref-backed reconcile-check gate. That real storage-path test exposed a pre-existing str-enum comparison defect: inherited lexical rich comparisons could mis-rank higher modes. Child 3c6a-4999-7466-46b1 repaired that production comparison boundary and is now closed with a current certificate.\n\nThe combined completed result preserves every legacy mode string and cap while making the advertised rank ordering real.\n\n## Completed approach\n\nParent-owned work:\n- tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/orchestrate/test_mode.py directly asserts the complete MODE_CAPS mapping: reconcile-check=0, dry-run=0, bootstrap-strict=10, bootstrap-throttle=100, live=None.\n- tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/state/test_advisory_lock.py round-trips gated_mode=reconcile-check through the real ref backend and proves an equal target is allowed while a higher target is blocked.\n\nChild 3c6a-owned production repair:\n- src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/mode.py makes all rich comparisons use the existing five-mode rank rather than inherited str lexical order.\n- Its tests cover every comparison operator, the real ref-backed gate, equivalent enum members from a second module load, and preservation of mode strings, MODE_CAPS, and from_str.\n\nThis is intentionally additive and backward compatible: no persisted value, command vocabulary, CLI default, Python library value, MCP payload, workflow input, or older installation contract changes.\n\n## Verification\n\nAt merged ref 694cf894def36241724e7049e3308d782037ef6d, run the focused mode and advisory-lock suites plus make lint, make typecheck, and make test. Repository tests prove the MODE_CAPS mapping and gate round trip directly. Child 3c6a records RED-first root-cause and green regression evidence for the production comparison repair.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [x] The parent-owned mode contract test directly asserts the complete MODE_CAPS mapping for all five legacy modes.\n- [x] The parent-owned real ref-backed test round-trips reconcile-check and proves equal-allowed versus higher-blocked behavior.\n- [x] Child 3c6a repairs every Mode rich comparison to follow reconcile-check < dry-run < bootstrap-strict < bootstrap-throttle < live.\n- [x] Existing mode strings, MODE_CAPS, from_str behavior, CLI/library/MCP vocabulary, workflow inputs, and persisted gate values remain unchanged.\n- [x] Focused suites, lint, typecheck, and the full CI test matrix pass at the merged ref.\n\n## Rollback\n\nThe characterization tests are additive. Reverting the child production repair would restore the proven lexical-comparison defect but requires no data migration because persisted strings and caps never changed.","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/orchestrate/test_mode.py","reason":"Pin the exact five-entry legacy MODE_CAPS contract."},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/state/test_advisory_lock.py","reason":"Characterize the real ref-backed reconcile-check phase-gate round trip and blocking boundary."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_reopened_at":1786440516425696001,"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[["parent","b42a-ffc3-deeb-4491"],["relates_to","64df-ec15-b6a2-4198"],["relates_to","6b6a-50ea-a031-4752"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"b42a-ffc3-deeb-4491","parent_status_uuid":"9a51172a-24dc-42c0-984c-1cca5b8b2516","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":["compatibility","tests","bridge"],"ticket_id":"2c87-80d5-755b-4026","ticket_type":"task","title":"Pin legacy reconciler mode-cap and phase-gate continuity","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["457d15b0-377f-4813-a45a-26ea8565852f","d844f8bb-73b4-4102-8fd8-b7e03033274e","26f3cd84-33a1-4792-8d45-a1c330fd063c","bc0618ff-2de1-4737-bd4b-37153a077360","7de3a0de-9f54-46dc-8f5b-d5af81e0a13e","1b3d246e-c667-4005-82e4-839f108d93ea","9575fe3e-17ef-4eee-96db-fa2a22ba505f","e1cad802-c179-4f0c-b5f1-894f77af149e","d6beef2e-6402-4f41-a29b-596c5d261220","08e7241c-b9a3-491a-9f6f-4e9d7fce1235","3c830a5d-d693-49b2-8d3b-b9a441388d50","9a51172a-24dc-42c0-984c-1cca5b8b2516","4907744e-cf4b-44f0-896f-57b3655d1cd0"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786659545801284001,"uuid":"b192f3b7-77c9-4ed7-a899-d48dac841d36"}